OL,11,G0532 Dear Daughter
OL,12,     FIn 2010, 19-year-old Ann was
OL,13,     Fkilled by her boyfriend. Her
OL,14,     Fmother, Kate, tells Namulanta
OL,15,     Fabout how she chose restorative
OL,16,     Fjustice over court to confront the
OL,17,     Fimpact of her death.
